BT /F1 13 Tf 50 710 Td (1. Executive Summary & Project Overview) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 690 Td (The Linked List Management System is an interactive, menu-driven console) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 676 Td (application for practicing dynamic linear data structures. Implemented from scratch) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 662 Td (in Java, it contains a full-featured Singly Linked List (19 operations) and) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 648 Td (Doubly Linked List (20 operations), adhering to all academic specifications.) Tj ET
