BT /F2 10 Tf 50 600 Td (- Object Reference Model: Uses explicit object chaining (node.next, node.prev)) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 586 Td (  avoiding raw pointer arithmetic pitfalls while retaining dynamic memory modeling.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 572 Td (- Automatic Garbage Collection: Safely reclaims memory for unlinked nodes) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 558 Td (  via JVM GC root reachability, preventing memory leaks and dangling references.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 544 Td (- Strong Typing & Robust I/O: Encapsulates static Node classes with Scanner validation.) Tj ET
