BT /F2 10 Tf 50 467 Td (2. DoublyLinkedList.java: Bidirectional list maintaining head and tail references.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 453 Td (3. Main.java: Interactive console menu with full input validation & comparison UI.) Tj ET
