BT /F1 12 Tf 50 580 Td (7. Key Algorithm Highlights) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 562 Td (- Middle Element: Floyd's slow/fast pointers. For even-length lists (2k nodes),) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 548 Td (  rule selects the upper/second middle (pos k+1) while reporting both central nodes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 534 Td (- In-Place Reversal: Re-links next in SLL; swaps prev and next in DLL in O(1) space.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 520 Td (- Bubble Sort: In-place data swapping with early-termination swapped flag optimization.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 506 Td (- Duplicate Removal: Runner pointer O(n^2) time, O(1) space, preserves valid links.) Tj ET
